CREATE TABLE "FixedAsset" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"entityId" TEXT NOT NULL,"code" TEXT NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"category" TEXT NOT NULL,"acquisitionDate" DATETIME NOT NULL,"inServiceDate" DATETIME NOT NULL,"grossValue" INTEGER NOT NULL,"salvageValue" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"usefulLifeMonths" INTEGER NOT NULL,"method" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'STRAIGHT_LINE',"assetAccountCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"depreciationAccountCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"expenseAccountCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"accumulatedDepreciation" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"bookValue" INTEGER NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'IN_SERVICE',"costCenterCode" TEXT,"supportingDocumentReference" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdByUserId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL,FOREIGN KEY("entityId") REFERENCES "Entity"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "FixedAsset_entityId_code_key" ON "FixedAsset"("entityId","code");
CREATE INDEX "FixedAsset_entityId_status_inServiceDate_idx" ON "FixedAsset"("entityId","status","inServiceDate");
CREATE TABLE "FinancialProvision" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"entityId" TEXT NOT NULL,"code" TEXT NOT NULL,"description" TEXT NOT NULL,"nature" TEXT NOT NULL,"period" TEXT NOT NULL,"amount" INTEGER NOT NULL,"expenseAccountCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"provisionAccountCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"costCenterCode" TEXT,"supportingDocumentReference" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'DRAFT',"createdByUserId" TEXT NOT NULL,"approvedByUserId" TEXT,"postedJournalEntryId" TEXT,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"approvedAt" DATETIME,"postedAt" DATETIME,FOREIGN KEY("entityId") REFERENCES "Entity"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "FinancialProvision_entityId_code_key" ON "FinancialProvision"("entityId","code");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "FinancialProvision_postedJournalEntryId_key" ON "FinancialProvision"("postedJournalEntryId");
CREATE INDEX "FinancialProvision_entityId_period_status_idx" ON "FinancialProvision"("entityId","period","status");
CREATE TABLE "AnalyticalAllocationRule" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,"entityId" TEXT NOT NULL,"countryCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"documentType" TEXT NOT NULL,"naturePattern" TEXT NOT NULL,"accountCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"costCenterCode" TEXT NOT NULL,"percentage" REAL NOT NULL,"priority" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 100,"isActive" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,"updatedByUserId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" DATETIME NOT NULL,FOREIGN KEY("entityId") REFERENCES "Entity"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "AnalyticalAllocationRule_entityId_countryCode_documentType_isActive_priority_idx" ON "AnalyticalAllocationRule"("entityId","countryCode","documentType","isActive","priority");
